Looking at this problem, I need to determine the dimension of $V = \prod_{i \in I} \mathbb{C} = \mathbb{C}^I$ (the space of all functions $I \to \mathbb{C}$) and whether it equals $|I|$.

**Answer leak check:** The problem contains no leaked solutions or answers. Proceeding.

